# Build output — `make dev` / `build`, `sync-shell`, `make release`
core/bin/
core/internal/uibundle/dist/
dist/

# A bare `go build ./cmd/dcode` inside core/ drops the binary next to the package
/core/dcode

# Generated by `make i18n seed`; `make i18n apply` merges it back
translations/work/

# From importing a module under tools/ or translations/ (python3 -m py_compile, a debugger session).
__pycache__/

# A redirect from a manual session (`make run 2> run.log`). The daemon's own log is written to
# $XDG_STATE_HOME/dcode/daemon.log, outside the repository.
/*.log

# Nothing here reads a .env, but a key is one `cp` away from the tree and one `git add -A` from
# being published. One line buys that back.
.env
